## Direct PDF (no Accept) — use for normal WhatsApp PDF sends

Separate from Accept. Letter + light emojis; DOCUMENT header; Call us + Website.

| Kind | Eleven | Hydrogen |
|------|--------|----------|
| Any label | `svc_doc_direct_ero_v1` | `svc_doc_direct_hro_v1` |
| Per-kind | `svc_doc_{bill\|invoice\|amc\|…}_ero_v3` | `svc_doc_*_hro_v3` |

- Direct: `{{1}}` name, `{{2}}` doc label (“AMC agreement”, …).
- Per-kind v3: `{{1}}` name only; fixed copy per type.
- CRM: `sendColdDocumentInvite` / `resolveDirectDocTemplate` / `resolveColdDocTemplateName` — **never** accept-preview for normal sends.
- Submit: `node scripts/submit-whatsapp-full-utility.mjs --submit --only-doc-direct`

## Accept-preview Meta templates (WhatsApp-only)

| Brand | Name |
|-------|------|
| Eleven | `svc_doc_accept_preview_ero_v8` (fallback `…_v7`) |
| Hydrogen | `svc_doc_accept_preview_hro_v8` (fallback `…_v7`) |

- DOCUMENT header (preview PDF) + body (name + doc label) + **Call us** + **I Accept** quick reply.
- Until Meta APPROVES v7/v8, cold Accept outside 24h fails; in-window interactive still works.
- CRM helpers: `resolveDocAcceptPreviewTemplate`, `docAcceptPreviewBodyParams` in `src/lib/whatsappColdTemplates.ts`.
- Submit: `node scripts/submit-whatsapp-full-utility.mjs --submit --only-doc-accept`

## Security (required when building)

- Opaque cryptographically random **single-use** token (invite id in DB; not a public web URL).
- Token tied to one document + one customer + one WA number; expire ~48h.
- Server-side Accept only (webhook); never trust client amount/name/hash.
- Soft-fail WhatsApp paths where appropriate; RLS on tables.
- No OTP in v1 (WhatsApp delivery is enough).

## Audit to store on Accept

`document_id`, `customer_id`, WA number, PDF SHA-256 (original), version, confirmation timestamp, IP/UA if appropriate, unique confirmation id, status, WA message id if available.

## Out of scope / do not do

- Require drawn signature.
- Treat print/screenshot of preview as original.
- Skip authenticity fingerprint on the **original** PDF send (keep existing hash + verify code rules).
- Merge to main / Netlify deploy unless user asks.
- Rebuild web `/c/{token}` Accept as the default path unless the user explicitly asks.

## Build trigger

User says e.g. “build document accept” / “Require Accept”. Wire send after job/doc finalize via CRM checkbox + helpers above.
